ERHU ANDROID — PROPRIETARY LICENCE FOR FUTURE RELEASES
Review candidate prepared 10 November 2026

1. STATUS, SCOPE AND RIGHTS HOLDERS

These terms are prepared for original erhu Android contributions in version
1.0.18 and later versions expressly distributed under these terms. This local
licensing review branch is NOT approval to distribute a proprietary APK.
Resolve the clearance gates in LICENSING.md and the legal placeholders below
before publishing or relying on these candidate terms.

Kshitij H Kekunnaya and Lochan Thakke are the Android rights holders, each for
their own original contributions and only to the extent they control the
relevant rights. No assignment, equal copyright share, exclusive ownership of
every file or ownership of third-party material is asserted. COPYRIGHT.md
records the evidence and unresolved material.

The participants report a 50/50 Android commercial revenue arrangement. That is
separate from copyright ownership. This end-user licence does not create an
assignment or replace a separate revenue-sharing contract. Android and iOS
have independent operational, financial and licensing arrangements. These
terms grant no rights in iOS material and create no shared accounts, revenue
pool or administration arrangement.

