and run an authorized future release on devices you own or control for
personal, non-commercial use. You may keep a reasonable private backup. If
source is supplied, you may inspect it for personal, non-commercial study.
This is a licence to use the covered original material, not a sale or an
assignment. No future updates or support are promised. Other rights are
reserved, subject to Sections 4 and 5.

