redistribution, replacement, relinking, rebuilding and reverse engineering
for debugging modifications under LGPL or other applicable component terms
are not prohibited by restrictions on the original application material.
Necessary modifications of the combined work for such lawful personal use
are permitted to the extent required by those component terms.

These exceptions do not represent that current APK packaging already supplies
every required notice, corresponding source, object file or replacement
mechanism. Distribution must satisfy those obligations in practice. No
production signing credentials are granted or required to be disclosed by
